		(at 102.185 95.9875 90)
		(descr "TI RDN0011B QFN-FCMOD, 11 pins, 3.5x4.5x2.1 mm. Land per SNVSCS7E p.47 (drawing 4231197/B 08/2025), SOLDER MASK DEFINED (TI marks it PREFERRED), mask 0.05 inside metal. Pins 4 and 5 carry a lead-finger mask opening and 7 paste apertures each, per p.47 and p.48 (72% coverage of the mask opening). pinmap: Figure 5-1 TOP VIEW and the Pin Functions table, p.5 -- 1 PGOOD, 2 EN, 3 VIN, 4 VOUT, 5 SW, 6 SW, 7 BOOT, 8 VCC, 9 FB, 10 GND, 11 MODE/SYNC. view: top (land pattern and Fig 5-1 agree, pin 1 upper left in both; the p.46 terminal view is the mirrored bottom view and was used only to locate the body on the land datum).")
